      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The `bundleIds` resource represents the app’s unique identifier that you can register, modify, and delete. You need a bundle ID before you can assign capabilities with the `bundle-id-capabilities` resource or create a provisioning profile with the `profiles` resource.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/bundle-id-capabilities",
